  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.ibb.co%252f87nk2p2%252fOne-Block.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/87nk2p2/One-Block.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"126\"></strong></a></h2><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一個類似《IJAMinecraft》中<strong>OneBlock</strong>地圖的冒險地圖。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在這張地圖上，你將出現在虛空之上的一個方塊上。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你將永遠敲碎一個<strong>幸運方塊</strong>！祝你好運！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/5WyT6XT\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/5WyT6XT\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎來到</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">幸運OneBlock！</span></strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這張Minecraft地圖將帶你踏上一段刺激而</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">充滿挑戰的冒險，圍繞著一個<em><strong>單一方塊</strong></em>的<em><strong>幸運方塊</strong></em>展開。<br>準備好體驗充滿<strong>驚喜</strong>、<strong>危險</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">和<strong>機會</strong>的旅程，探索這個獨特而有限的世界。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/QJBT2Bh/bloggif-6485015b3d30f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"452\" height=\"254\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你的主要目標是充分利用那個特殊的方塊。<br>每次敲碎幸運方塊，都會觸發各種隨機事件，<br>從慷慨的獎勵到挑戰性的陷阱和強大的敵人。運氣將與你同在！</span><br><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">別忘了，策略和適應性是這張地圖生存的關鍵。<br>隨著進展，你可以將從幸運方塊中獲得的物品組合，<br>製作強大的武器、實用的工具和防護裝備。<br>掌握運氣之道，解鎖你的真正潛力！</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a>&nbsp;</span> </span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">1.16.5 - 1.20.2</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-lucky-block</a>&nbsp;</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.20.6<br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">此版本需要此模組</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Architectury API]</a></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/myluckyblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/myluckyblock</a></span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">1.21 - 1.21.11</span></span></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><em>這是我第一個使用資料包的地圖！</em></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>我會持續更新並改善體驗，設立目標與成就！</em><br><em>請大家多多支持，並給予良好的回饋<br></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">一個方塊搭配不同方塊，還有附加元件！</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-summer-oneblock\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky_Summer_OneBlock</a></span></span></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-summer-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ypcDxRm/Summer-lucky-block.gif\" width=\"285\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><a style=\"color:#f0f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock-pink-lucky\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky_OneBlock-Pink</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><a style=\"color:#f0f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock-pink-lucky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P4tZPcx/Untitled-1.gif\" width=\"293\" height=\"165\"></a><br></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#c2e0f4;text-align:center\">\n<h2><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-triple-oneblock\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky Triple OneBlock </a></span></h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-triple-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QH34YLb.gif\" width=\"275\" height=\"155\"></span></a></li>\n</ul><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>我的Discord：</em></strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B9rysAEFGk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"240\"></a></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fel_this_boy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://images.seeklogo.com/logo-png/47/2/buy-me-a-coffee-logo-png_seeklogo-477198.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"66\" height=\"66\">如果你想幫助我！你可以透過這個方式贊助我！<br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>[點擊這裡]</strong></span></span></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">點擊此處享25%折扣</span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下是讓它運行的步驟：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">伺服器要求：確保你的伺服器運行Forge或Fabric版本。幸運方塊必須與客戶端<strong>相同版本</strong>，這<strong>非常重要</strong>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">幸運方塊模組：你必須將幸運方塊模組放在<strong>mods資料夾</strong>中。沒有它，你將一直掉入虛空。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">步驟：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1- 下載地圖：確保你已下載Lucky OneBlock地圖，並將其放在<strong>saves資料夾</strong>中。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">2- 下載幸運方塊模組：下載幸運方塊模組，並將其放在<strong>mods資料夾</strong>中，然後使用<strong><em>Fabric</em>或Forge</strong>加載。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10px\">如果遇到問題！去YouTube搜尋！那裡什麼都有！</span><br><br></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">遊戲實況：</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>感謝!! @skipthetutorial</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RixDjnfIrhE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br></span></strong></span></p>",
